window.EXAUD={"My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "We do many fun activities at the weekend.": "audio/cau/996d76bf4c31cea3.mp3", "Mi is very active and loves outdoor activities.": "audio/cau/94fea0819039eaa4.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "I go to bed at ten o'clock.": "audio/cau/37f1c2a86a0f3867.mp3", "There is a bed and a desk in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/5306adc35ff279d9.mp3", "My bedroom is small but tidy.": "audio/cau/8f6e673cf7c0e7d7.mp3", "There is a big bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/a25f15f6ef9e509d.mp3", "There are two beds in my room.": "audio/cau/3cc7c6e3c214f1b9.mp3", "My bed is near the window; my sister's is near the door.": "audio/cau/80b572f1725475e4.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "Fill in each blank with one word.": "audio/cau/0b238b46fd929b2f.mp3", "Write the correct answer in the blank.": "audio/cau/8d62e86f859c14ce.mp3", "The teacher writes new words on the board.": "audio/cau/fc0708025342335f.mp3", "The board of directors chose a new leader for the company.": "audio/cau/95a699ba4ec66c0c.mp3", "She wrote a book about her life.": "audio/cau/428afa8d58f841a3.mp3", "Lan reads a book every week, so she has many books.": "audio/cau/5a4070779479f823.mp3", "Put the verbs in brackets in the correct form.": "audio/cau/db94e0ded7cf0ad1.mp3", "Write the word in brackets, like this: (go).": "audio/cau/35267fe98d59e0cc.mp3", "I have breakfast at 6:30 every morning.": "audio/cau/909be0d175127c67.mp3", "Mi often has pho for breakfast with her family.": "audio/cau/47d1bde3ee5ae0ad.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "You can use a calculator in the maths test.": "audio/cau/fda06b2439e1190d.mp3", "Phong used a calculator to calculate the total.": "audio/cau/82ae44e4975925f2.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "We live in a central part of the city.": "audio/cau/56cb7cd26e890a65.mp3", "The central market is near the city centre.": "audio/cau/d3670c2095eba83a.mp3", "There is a community centre in my area.": "audio/cau/29303f0e938051fb.mp3", "The city centre is busy, and the central park is big.": "audio/cau/d087f6159981d3e2.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Let's take a closer look at the words.": "audio/cau/3f25d4a7ecb1e46f.mp3", "Lan's house is close, but Mi's house is closer.": "audio/cau/95aeed65b79a000e.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "Success comes from hard work.": "audio/cau/104997cf355813ab.mp3", "Minh comes to school early, but yesterday he came late.": "audio/cau/8fc163a4c3b546e2.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "He bought his first computer at sixteen.": "audio/cau/89b36254c871cb46.mp3", "She studied computing and now makes computer games.": "audio/cau/bc002ad22303f977.mp3", "Physical health is connected with your body.": "audio/cau/634a8a166182ee10.mp3", "Social media helps teens stay connected.": "audio/cau/47a2c362738b4ca7.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Viet Nam is a beautiful country.": "audio/cau/df0215608f1e8de4.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside of our country.": "audio/cau/00375e3b63fb00b1.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Many people in Da Nang work downtown.": "audio/cau/937a590a251089b9.mp3", "Lan lives downtown, near the city centre market.": "audio/cau/ac4b9b9bb5e89502.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "What else can we do to stay healthy?": "audio/cau/10a061b0917c9692.mp3", "Ask someone else to help you.": "audio/cau/21b2214919853b5c.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "I have a maths exam tomorrow.": "audio/cau/a057069f2c02c041.mp3", "Lan studied hard for the exam, and she passed the test.": "audio/cau/862ea18aaf0d9c06.mp3", "Exams make many teens feel stressed.": "audio/cau/237d9365425494f8.mp3", "After the last exam, we can relax at last.": "audio/cau/bd52a0f7c4d7172f.mp3", "Let's do Exercise 2 together.": "audio/cau/8a86d82bda27ce85.mp3", "Lan finished all the exercises in the book.": "audio/cau/abcaa51bcd9bad34.mp3", "My grandparents have a small farm in the countryside.": "audio/cau/8dfbf1cdb8c722b6.mp3", "The farmer feeds the chickens on his farm.": "audio/cau/b7fa5397f8451fd9.mp3", "Lan is interested in fashion and music.": "audio/cau/c16e6190025bd97d.mp3", "These fashionable clothes are popular with teens.": "audio/cau/99dcfa9981242c08.mp3", "The children are flying kites in the field.": "audio/cau/cbc154160546b20b.mp3", "Farmers grow rice in the fields near our village.": "audio/cau/37cf9b7ad781c0dc.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Focus on the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/568e05bcb3ccde4d.mp3", "It's noisy, so Mi can't concentrate or focus on homework.": "audio/cau/e984cbce9e79c312.mp3", "Phong plays football with his friends.": "audio/cau/9baf509a6408f617.mp3", "Nam likes football and watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/617a4e3bf9b2e89d.mp3", "Don't forget your homework!": "audio/cau/42bcd3e580da9477.mp3", "Hoa forgot her book, but she remembered her pen.": "audio/cau/4fd2b5e71375a59b.mp3", "'Always' and 'often' are adverbs of frequency.": "audio/cau/fb2e6b6f7856fbcc.mp3", "Lan frequently visits her grandma, about twice a week.": "audio/cau/67d1f13f4283a9eb.mp3", "Traffic jams frequently happen in big cities.": "audio/cau/450220468c84a350.mp3", "Nam often swims; he frequently goes to the pool.": "audio/cau/0e28d1733f45c19e.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My uncle is very funny.": "audio/cau/3365f3c2b0a43869.mp3", "Phong is funny, so playing with him is fun.": "audio/cau/754492bd17fda5cf.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "Fill in each gap with a word from the box.": "audio/cau/afa644b720499eae.mp3", "Read the sentence, then fill the gap with the right word.": "audio/cau/1c138053d1f45bdd.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "She gets on well with her neighbours.": "audio/cau/70e1470c821aaa7b.mp3", "It gets cold in winter, and last week it got very cold.": "audio/cau/818ce29897902e0d.mp3", "It's getting dark, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/a5d44c2a5398af17.mp3", "Minh got up late, so he is getting ready quickly.": "audio/cau/be131cb99a335b88.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "We need more green spaces in the city.": "audio/cau/7e358d9d053e2d45.mp3", "Our city is green, and it is getting greener.": "audio/cau/a9cfdf8c1935609c.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "Good health brings happiness.": "audio/cau/d40ad946903ff046.mp3", "Her face was full of happiness.": "audio/cau/cf704e43df3396fb.mp3", "I am happy to see my friends again.": "audio/cau/29fdd3b9f6ed1e66.mp3", "Mi smiles happily because she is happy.": "audio/cau/feee63efb252ba2b.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "Minh loves reading books about Vietnamese history.": "audio/cau/b45e7916c38300d0.mp3", "Our history teacher is a historian who loves old stories.": "audio/cau/2313e8627924b236.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "Let me introduce my best friend, Nam.": "audio/cau/5b8362e776b65068.mp3", "Mi wrote a short introduction to introduce herself.": "audio/cau/f3c76dad15928ed4.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "I learnt a new song today.": "audio/cau/002dc8ba978f437b.mp3", "Mi likes to learn new words; yesterday she learnt ten.": "audio/cau/01afc6c13b541caf.mp3", "Could you lend me your pen, please?": "audio/cau/40209fe783cf272d.mp3", "Nam lent me a book, and I'll borrow another tomorrow.": "audio/cau/589c3a2aa17ce3c9.mp3", "Students read books in the school library.": "audio/cau/652b3f1867b52ca4.mp3", "The librarian helps us find books in the library.": "audio/cau/75a040e0524410b2.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "My cousin lives in a flat in the city centre.": "audio/cau/6c1c9af9fa483b7a.mp3", "Lan lives in Da Nang, and her grandparents live in Hoi An.": "audio/cau/cad509dd3acaf3f4.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Please don't be loud in the library.": "audio/cau/b4956ef2c49e1b40.mp3", "Nam has a loud voice, and he sings loudly.": "audio/cau/956ffd4ad9cd7167.mp3", "We have lunch at school at half past eleven.": "audio/cau/9e8a6c5dd05e9964.mp3", "At lunchtime, Mi has lunch with Lan in the canteen.": "audio/cau/46b84d5e7aebbd51.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "Hoa got good marks in her English test.": "audio/cau/a09e13fa0a284ed8.mp3", "Sleeping well can help you get better marks.": "audio/cau/e545780dfc83a07b.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures.": "audio/cau/c554f0656d3ab896.mp3", "Match the names with the photos and connect them with lines.": "audio/cau/b9cb7dc9f6dfba6f.mp3", "Maths is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/c4dbac3c27e1034e.mp3", "Mathematics, or maths, is hard but fun.": "audio/cau/6ffbed30122c7baa.mp3", "Mai sits in the middle of the first row.": "audio/cau/fb9af6047d7545a8.mp3", "There is a table in the middle, or centre, of the room.": "audio/cau/d1fcde7c79b36590.mp3", "Wait a minute, please.": "audio/cau/253cc68d07c9fa9b.mp3", "It takes me fifteen minutes to walk; one minute is sixty seconds.": "audio/cau/875874e3b9240ef0.mp3", "The bus comes every ten minutes.": "audio/cau/f396dbb822ada738.mp3", "Wait a minute; the film starts in five minutes.": "audio/cau/74a1836c371b68d0.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has many modern buildings.": "audio/cau/810253cd103ab3c9.mp3", "The old town is traditional, but the new area is modern.": "audio/cau/f96ce31b6ef5078e.mp3", "Mr Nam is our English teacher.": "audio/cau/38bbba50eac133a3.mp3", "Mr Minh and Ms Lan work at my school.": "audio/cau/22a842da4f6100e9.mp3", "Ms Hoa teaches us maths.": "audio/cau/f0b35b8376d075b8.mp3", "Ms Lan and Mr Phong are our class teachers.": "audio/cau/6709f6324593fcc8.mp3", "I listen to music every evening.": "audio/cau/947b04b66aabe669.mp3", "Phong loves music, and he wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/2a338296f019ee09.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has an exciting nightlife.": "audio/cau/db63b206001cd606.mp3", "The nightlife here is lively, and the streets are busy at night.": "audio/cau/3d60979904eca10a.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Make a note of the new words.": "audio/cau/8bdaf02876855cac.mp3", "I write a short note in my notebook.": "audio/cau/3b565057bfcdee58.mp3", "I write new words in my notebook.": "audio/cau/54f4386b8856f178.mp3", "Mi's notebook is full of short notes.": "audio/cau/684bf34705fb9a6b.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "A: I'm sorry I'm late. B: That's OK.": "audio/cau/1bbe28ae96b898d1.mp3", "Are you OK? You look tired.": "audio/cau/26aa4543d75a47ea.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "Read the first paragraph and answer the question.": "audio/cau/43e8d58106b6726a.mp3", "Write a short paragraph of about 80 words.": "audio/cau/79fc537e0a2633c9.mp3", "Mai and Lan swap paragraphs and check them.": "audio/cau/8ce60ddee9a706f4.mp3", "Minh writes two paragraphs about his daily routine.": "audio/cau/cfa99a15b21c6270.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "Can I borrow your pen, please?": "audio/cau/219492b77e8bce23.mp3", "Write in pen, not in pencil.": "audio/cau/61e51310622e9a99.mp3", "I draw a picture with my pencil.": "audio/cau/ecf39c9e499950e3.mp3", "Put your pen and pencil in your pencil case.": "audio/cau/cebdbe1b42b4a461.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "Lan plays the piano every evening.": "audio/cau/3a62c8f36426a684.mp3", "My cousin is a pianist, and she teaches me the piano.": "audio/cau/af9a9112e50f8faa.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "Nam and Phong play football after school.": "audio/cau/4f990530a36010eb.mp3", "The children play in the playground at break time.": "audio/cau/01c38c5563b4ece0.mp3", "The children play football in the playground.": "audio/cau/ba97d8ec376ab1f4.mp3", "Lan and Hoa play games in the school playground.": "audio/cau/16841dfb20eb6b7d.mp3", "I'm pleased to meet you.": "audio/cau/f7277017f0c93fd1.mp3", "The teacher is pleased with our work.": "audio/cau/ef3a88639bfe5e25.mp3", "There is a pool near my house.": "audio/cau/207ceb0aa465a551.mp3", "We go to the swimming pool every Saturday.": "audio/cau/d6aba7333a767ece.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "Our group gave a presentation about a famous person.": "audio/cau/19eabc250c35918d.mp3", "Minh presents the first part of the presentation.": "audio/cau/97ffec456b1ba8a6.mp3", "How do you pronounce this word?": "audio/cau/6c9e46c3da62473a.mp3", "Listen and pronounce the words; your pronunciation is getting better.": "audio/cau/92e0fae3ce63ad4b.mp3", "Let's practise pronunciation: /b/ and /p/.": "audio/cau/fe10978f3f45d336.mp3", "Pronounce the words carefully to improve your pronunciation.": "audio/cau/69ee019cb8468b45.mp3", "Put your books on the desk.": "audio/cau/2d454633026296cc.mp3", "Yesterday I put my bike in the garage.": "audio/cau/4337fe6ef9062f07.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "Hoa has a white rabbit.": "audio/cau/012ae5b5a303a93b.mp3", "The rabbit has long ears and eats carrots.": "audio/cau/c826d2369c36c8b3.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Lan is wearing a red dress.": "audio/cau/ae3c1aa62302c501.mp3", "The sky is reddish at sunset, and the sun is red.": "audio/cau/6fcd7d055aec1d60.mp3", "Find three words related to life stories.": "audio/cau/a35a94f3c1f834e3.mp3", "These two ideas are related, so connect them.": "audio/cau/cea4243854336025.mp3", "Mi has a good relationship with her neighbours.": "audio/cau/67664fd4120bb4b4.mp3", "Good relationships make our community stronger.": "audio/cau/28d1b1022fb685d1.mp3", "Do you remember Mi's birthday?": "audio/cau/32d012431282fc9b.mp3", "Remember to bring your book; don't forget it!": "audio/cau/b5bf1b42faeeef1f.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "My room is small but very tidy.": "audio/cau/bd9658dea75a069a.mp3", "There are five rooms in my house.": "audio/cau/a28138f93ee20867.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "There are three schools in my neighbourhood.": "audio/cau/e7472804805a2d4e.mp3", "Our school is near the market.": "audio/cau/fa70824b93079294.mp3", "I do my schoolwork after dinner.": "audio/cau/e23aba9733535f02.mp3", "Balance your schoolwork and your free time.": "audio/cau/f600407c49eb58a5.mp3", "We play games in the schoolyard at break time.": "audio/cau/b333225dd0305308.mp3", "Our schoolyard is big and has many trees.": "audio/cau/8a7f8efa43115ba5.mp3", "Can you see the picture on page ten?": "audio/cau/505d4b7b963a3756.mp3", "I saw Lan yesterday, and I'll see her tomorrow.": "audio/cau/d14cce6b0cd0e6db.mp3", "Have you seen the new market in town?": "audio/cau/0689eb245aec2ebc.mp3", "Yes, I have seen it; I saw it last week.": "audio/cau/476814d0d69a0131.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Please shorten your report to one page.": "audio/cau/dee63c16ae986ee6.mp3", "The story is too long, so make it short.": "audio/cau/b95346b6a813da23.mp3", "There is a shower in the bathroom.": "audio/cau/ff633fcfe2cfdb92.mp3", "I have a shower every evening.": "audio/cau/3457975e31c037ca.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "We sing English songs in class.": "audio/cau/026846f6b8826235.mp3", "Mi sang a song; she is a good singer.": "audio/cau/880ccad023e24637.mp3", "Lan is singing a song for her friends.": "audio/cau/f33095eb48c8ac05.mp3", "Nam loves singing, and he sang at the party.": "audio/cau/9fafc99845e3f01a.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "I sometimes walk to school with Nam.": "audio/cau/58614921c43016ec.mp3", "Mi sometimes cooks dinner with her mum.": "audio/cau/cc769dc4c6e5b938.mp3", "This is my favourite song.": "audio/cau/541e14c148c17e10.mp3", "Let's sing a song together!": "audio/cau/2582c08c2be3a294.mp3", "Please sort the rubbish before you throw it away.": "audio/cau/6c05fa141d6fcfcf.mp3", "What sort of rubbish can we recycle?": "audio/cau/ece2a3deda17cf66.mp3", "Which word has the sound /əʊ/?": "audio/cau/abdd497b61506cce.mp3", "I love the sound of the rain at night.": "audio/cau/6a34a72a03c00f3a.mp3", "Listen and repeat the sounds /b/ and /p/.": "audio/cau/82fd56c054a4daa9.mp3", "The /b/ sound in 'robe' is voiced.": "audio/cau/1a965cfa2b894959.mp3", "Our city needs more space for parks.": "audio/cau/4789110f4d6851be.mp3", "The new flat is spacious, with lots of space.": "audio/cau/9028743b09798c85.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "My grandfather started work when he was fifteen.": "audio/cau/9cd956a07a50d11d.mp3", "The film started at seven and finished at nine.": "audio/cau/7b234820845db47a.mp3", "Follow these steps to make a poster.": "audio/cau/98072d2331910aac.mp3", "The last step is to show your poster to the class.": "audio/cau/4892be374595ef8d.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "My favourite subject is science.": "audio/cau/a04c6f77a736db47.mp3", "Maths is a hard subject, but I like it.": "audio/cau/47c097cdda067846.mp3", "I can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3c5deaf967abfe9e.mp3", "Nam swam in the river yesterday; he is a good swimmer.": "audio/cau/33e4aee3ddd78677.mp3", "Yes, he is swimming in the pool now.": "audio/cau/f38b8b56f777a2a1.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite sport.": "audio/cau/0e068932f6569c52.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My father is very tall.": "audio/cau/fbbb73825cd6c0b9.mp3", "Minh is tall, but Phong is short.": "audio/cau/dc16694351cdb299.mp3", "My mother will teach me how to cook.": "audio/cau/a219134d114e3ba6.mp3", "Mr Minh taught me English, and he is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/f4262b30c0d7e28d.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "Mr Phong teaches us how to make pottery.": "audio/cau/b810d8c5f8302b58.mp3", "She teaches maths now; last year she taught science.": "audio/cau/2dc58c5f8f5cc111.mp3", "Hoa adds her coming tests to her schedule.": "audio/cau/a6c040d304b498b4.mp3", "Minh has two tests next week.": "audio/cau/424c9df67f502131.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "I had breakfast, and then I went to school.": "audio/cau/e707895b95dcb0e6.mp3", "First, wash the rice. Next, cook it. Then, eat it.": "audio/cau/2bb6330c0be506ed.mp3", "Lan is going to bed early tonight.": "audio/cau/082a4a419bcc862e.mp3", "If you stay up late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow.": "audio/cau/67679aa3684d9212.mp3", "The topic of our talk is city life.": "audio/cau/d835d42e9ee7296c.mp3", "Choose one subject; that is your topic.": "audio/cau/de9fb4a3b7a5341a.mp3", "We discussed many topics in class.": "audio/cau/70154001b868bf44.mp3", "Of all the topics, my favourite topic is food.": "audio/cau/b9869f0cde210ef9.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "Bat Trang is famous for traditional pottery.": "audio/cau/af80d363c35bf8b2.mp3", "This tradition is old, but the shop is modern.": "audio/cau/a518363de6b74f38.mp3", "A flat is a type of house.": "audio/cau/b519e22f39271e2a.mp3", "What type of house do you like? I like this kind.": "audio/cau/256a68fa7015d647.mp3", "There are many types of houses in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e5ec6990a0243557.mp3", "A villa is one type of house; which type do you like?": "audio/cau/36ad9745be611d00.mp3", "Below are some of the typical things I did.": "audio/cau/66d53ae758a3f7b4.mp3", "Pho is a typical Vietnamese breakfast.": "audio/cau/fbe03a0e67ca0879.mp3", "The street looks ugly with all that rubbish.": "audio/cau/84027adc63b4f048.mp3", "The park was ugly before, but now it is beautiful.": "audio/cau/133c40c5a01388aa.mp3", "People are unhappy with the traffic jams.": "audio/cau/8f666d0d974f8f0e.mp3", "Lan was unhappy yesterday, but today she is happy.": "audio/cau/79b51e0a7de4a479.mp3", "The workers wear a green uniform with stripes.": "audio/cau/b182c1a9488baa66.mp3", "We wear our school uniform from Monday to Friday.": "audio/cau/4c928807169b0cdf.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "We grow vegetables in our garden.": "audio/cau/d92956c6548928c2.mp3", "Hoa is a vegetarian, so she eats a lot of vegetables.": "audio/cau/1325f06e6a7fd282.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Mi talks to Nick on a video call.": "audio/cau/7ffc18e81364c319.mp3", "We watch a video about stilt houses.": "audio/cau/2a7f65066f157bbb.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "There are many craft villages near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9064f8b48096eb71.mp3", "Bat Trang is a famous pottery village.": "audio/cau/7212e9943aa25d4c.mp3", "I walk to school every day.": "audio/cau/0a109a8251b16954.mp3", "Mi walked in the park and enjoyed her walk.": "audio/cau/f2ec11ed20a260e3.mp3", "My grandfather walks in the park every morning.": "audio/cau/d3a46831c03ac217.mp3", "Hoa walks to school, and she enjoys the walk.": "audio/cau/1936de068b59ecd9.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Workers wear helmets at work.": "audio/cau/58cc64267deb5ef1.mp3", "Mi usually wears jeans, but yesterday she wore a dress.": "audio/cau/23bb4a0107f750d1.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "Nam wore jeans yesterday, but today he is wearing trousers.": "audio/cau/f93860f5b315d691.mp3", "The electrician wears a uniform.": "audio/cau/e61ef88174b570fe.mp3", "Lan wears glasses, and she wore them in the photo too.": "audio/cau/930bd22d0c295d4b.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3"};
